\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-225\li225\sl196\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\cf0  I am a poor sinner
\par \pard\li225\sl196\slmult0 It is so with me,
\par and my Lord and Saviour
\par \pard\li225\sl196\slmult0\qj also love me so
\par that He cannot live me in my sins alone
\par It is by His mercies and His Love alone.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl196\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.  Jesus Christ your Mercies
\par \pard\li225\sl196\slmult0\qj and my sins and pains
\par there are only two things
\par that can touch my heart
\par And my heart will tell me I deserve His wrath.
\par And my Jesus responds that; I've done  so well
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl196\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par  3.  Any gift He gives me
\par \pard\li225\sl196\slmult0\qj  makes me feel ashamed
\par  I deserve not, I know,
\par  but I am so glad.
\par  I could see that He will never forsake me.
\par  He will take me to Heaven forever more
\par 
\par \pard\fi-180\li180\sl196\slmult0\qj\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.  Christ has filled my soul with
\par \pard\li180\sl196\slmult0  all of His blessings.
\par  And He gave me promise
\par  that I will be saved
\par  And so I am so free and no more frightened
\par \pard     I shall never not argue and be so calm.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs14 
\par }

